    "caption": "Offline evals gate every change, online evals score sampled production traffic, and reviewed failures become new cases in the dataset that feeds the gate.",
    "alt": "A pull request runs the smoke eval tier, whose results go to a regression gate. If it passes, the change merges and deploys; if it fails, the regressed case IDs go back to the pull request. In production, sampled traces are scored by online evals; low scores go to a review queue, and reviewed failures are promoted into the dataset that feeds the smoke tier.",
